  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T12:38:33.503894Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T12:52:31.640936Z",
  "totalBlocks": 26,
  "translatedBlocks": 26,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08f7710da96e527f",
      "translationZh": "我最近一直在一台新的 Linux 机器上配置 Qwen3.8 27B，看到最近大家在讨论 7900 XTX 的性能，就想分享一些数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b186163053b323d",
      "translationZh": "模型驻留：100% GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "85ef14f553addcdc",
      "translationZh": "提示词处理：215.8 t/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9e2319cb6bbdc0f",
      "translationZh": "使用当前版本的 llama.cpp 构建，设置 GGML_VULKAN=ON，显式选择 RX 7900 XTX，所有层均放在 GPU 上，启用 Flash Attention，并使用 q8 KV 缓存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75e2acbfbb32648a",
      "translationZh": "对我来说，有意思的是，将上下文从 64K 缩减到 8K，解码速度几乎完全没变：35.8 → 36.0 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f42991ff0b6daef0",
      "translationZh": "所以在我的系统上，单用 Vulkan 的 token 生成速度仅比 Ollama/ROCm 快大约 4%，而在 64K 上下文下，Ollama 的提示词处理性能实际上更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4df75e7603ac071",
      "translationZh": "我看到有人报告的生成速率明显更高，有时能达到 60–100 t/s，所以我很好奇是什么造成了这种差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6a657bd4e9615fc",
      "translationZh": "这主要是因为 MTP/推测解码、不同的 llama.cpp 标志/构建版本、不同的量化版本，还是有其他我遗漏的 AMD/Vulkan 优化？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7179eca307d9cc77",
      "translationZh": "目前，Ollama 在这套配置上的表现实际上出乎意料地有竞争力，尤其考虑到我能在 64K 上下文长度下，完全在 VRAM 中运行 27B 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "210381b58a3dafdc",
      "translationZh": "如果大家想比较特定的参数标志或配置，我很乐意运行更多基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22ba1adfb3a6e620",
      "translationZh": "更新：规范的 llama-bench + MTP 测试结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5506e30fb062820f",
      "translationZh": "感谢大家的反馈。有几位朋友正确地指出，我最初测得的交互式提示词处理数据无法与 llama-bench 直接比较，所以我按规范重新进行了测试，随后也测试了 MTP。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "738f1a4af9fb791e",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp 构建版本 10816 / 提交 427291b5b",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a11741a5e91fe740",
      "translationZh": "重要澄清：65,536 上下文指的是已配置的、可用的上下文长度，而不是这些测试中已经填入了 65K 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "86f56a7ec5165eba",
      "translationZh": "标准 llama-bench 基线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3fd4b598af09c07",
      "translationZh": "Vulkan，所有层均在 GPU 上，启用 Flash Attention，q8 KV：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cab772cdafe65dd1",
      "translationZh": "所以，显卡/后端本身看起来运行正常。我在原帖中给出的约 200 t/s 的提示词处理数据，只是交互式提示词的计时结果，不应与 pp512 相比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c8c4d2d00d8f7ba",
      "translationZh": "随后，我在 Vulkan 下启用了原生 Qwen MTP，其他所有设置保持不变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a66eab1a6a15b35",
      "translationZh": "一次快速的单提示词测试结果如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5437ec17ae579cc",
      "translationZh": "由于推测解码的性能高度依赖工作负载/接受率，我不想仅凭一个提示词就在 n3 和 n4 之间做选择。我运行了五种不同的工作负载，每次测试都启动一个全新的 llama-cli 会话，并为 n3 和 n4 使用完全相同的提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26e517f578e4b448",
      "translationZh": "因此，在这套配置的实际使用中，n3 和 n4 基本打成平手。n3 在 3/5 的工作负载中胜出，平均值和中位数也略好一些，但平均值的差异只有约百分之零点五。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de16a38860b1dd98",
      "translationZh": "更重要的结果是，MTP 让这张显卡运行这个模型时的速度，从普通解码时的约 36–37 t/s，提升到了这些混合工作负载下平均约 69–70 t/s，个别运行还超过了 80 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2e27ecac680dbf1",
      "translationZh": "这似乎也解释了我的数据与那些报告在 7900 XTX 上达到 50–80+ t/s 的人的数据为何不同：其中很大一部分差异来自推测解码/MTP 的性能，而非原始的单 token 解码性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fbbe126c2594337",
      "translationZh": "我还没有测试 ngram-mod，所以特意没有将它纳入这些数据。评论中有一些关于 MTP + ngram 以及不同量化/KV 设置的有趣建议，我接下来可能会测试这些。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5cb8cfc63e94067",
      "translationZh": "如果有人想复现这项使用五个提示词进行的 n3/n4 对比，我很乐意公布具体的提示词和启动参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc3a5ccc2e61abd9",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/AIOfficialBot 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
